            <mattext texttype="text/html"><![CDATA[
<p><strong>Pooled Standard Deviation (3 points)</strong></p>
<p>Two independent samples are collected to compare cholesterol levels between two diets:</p>
<ul>
<li>Diet 1: n<sub>1</sub> = 12, s<sub>1</sub> = 18.5 mg/dL</li>
<li>Diet 2: n<sub>2</sub> = 15, s<sub>2</sub> = 21.3 mg/dL</li>
</ul>
<p>Calculate the pooled standard deviation using the formula provided in class.</p>
<p><strong>Provide your answer in the following format:</strong></p>
<ol>
<li>The formula you're using (in notation or R code)</li>
<li>Your calculation (R code or by-hand steps)</li>
<li>The pooled standard deviation (rounded to 2 decimal places)</li>
</ol>
